{"id":"NCT07234461","title":"Sexual Well-being of Women Undergoing Mastectomy and Reconstruction","official":"Sexual Well-being of Women Undergoing Mastectomy and Reconstruction: a National Survey.","summary":"The study plans to collect data from patients on sexual well-being after mastectomy and immediate reconstruction by surveys.\n\nThis data can support preoperative patient counselling and the prevention and care of adverse effects of cancer treatments.\n\nSpecific subpopulations of mastectomy women showing severe sexual impairment can be outlined; they may benefit from lifestyle changes and intervention strategies (intravaginal use of diazepam, local hyaluronic acid, intravaginal use of spermidine, pelvic floor gymnastic and physiotherapy).\n\nOur goal is to improve quality of life of breast cancer patients.","conditions":["Mastectomy and Breast Reconstruction","Sexual Wellness"],"interventions":[{"type":"OTHER","name":"Survey using a questionnaire."}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients undergoing mastectomy for primary breast cancer;\n* High-risk healthy patients undergoing risk reducing mastectomies;\n* Unilateral and/or bilateral mastectomies;\n* If unilateral mastectomy, both patients requiring or not contralateral mammaplasty of the healthy breast;\n* All reconstructive procedures included (autologous and heterologous reconstructions).\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patients undergoing breast conservation;\n* Patients who previously underwent breast cancer treatment, requiring further surgery for local relapse or secondary breast cancers;\n* Delayed post-mastectomy reconstructions;\n* Patients not available for e-correspondence.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"FEMALE","healthy":true,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"OTHER","enrollment":200,"start":"2026-01-21","pcd":"2026-10","upd":"2026-02-04","sponsor":"European Institute of Oncology","areas":["other"],"central":["Francesca De Lorenzi, MD · +39 0257489.394 · francesca.delorenzi@ieo.it"],"sites":[{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliero Universitaria Consorziale Policlinico","city":"Bari","pr":"","zip":"70124","s":"NYR","lat":41.1207,"lon":16.8698,"c":"Angela Gurrado, MD · +39 080 919 8749 · urp.policlinico.bari@pec.rupar.puglia.it"},{"f":"Istituto Tumori Giovanni Paolo II","city":"Bari","pr":"","zip":"70124","s":"NYR","lat":41.1207,"lon":16.8698,"c":"Daniela Anna Cutrignelli, MD · +39 0805555917 · d.cutrignelli@oncologico.bari.it"},{"f":"Policlinico Sant'Orsola-Malpighi","city":"Bologna","pr":"","zip":"40138","s":"NYR","lat":44.4938,"lon":11.3387,"c":"Chiara Gelati, MD · +39 051 2143614 · angela.sandoni@aosp.bo.it"},{"f":"Ospedale Bufalini di Cesena","city":"Cesena","pr":"","zip":"47521","s":"NYR","lat":44.1391,"lon":12.2431,"c":"Rossella Sgarzani, MD · +39 0547 352111 · rossella.sgarzani2@unibo.it"},{"f":"Presidio Ospedaliero GB Morgagni-Pierantoni","city":"Forlì","pr":"","zip":"47121","s":"NYR","lat":44.2218,"lon":12.0414,"c":"Annalisa Curcio, MD · +39 0543731676 · curcioannalisa@hotmail.it"},{"f":"European Institute of Oncology","city":"Milan","pr":"","zip":"20141","s":"R","lat":45.4643,"lon":9.1895,"c":"Francesca De Lorenzi, MD · +39 0257489.394 · francesca.delorenzi@ieo.it"},{"f":"Ospedale Mater Olbia","city":"Olbia","pr":"","zip":"07026","s":"NYR","lat":40.9234,"lon":9.498,"c":"Sonia Bove, MD · +39 0789 18999 · sonia.bove@materolbia.com"},{"f":"Azienda Ospedale Università di Padova","city":"Padova","pr":"","zip":"35128","s":"NYR","lat":45.5009,"lon":9.2346,"c":"Laura Pandis, MD · +39 0498212768 · chir.plastica@aopd.veneto.it"},{"f":"Policlinico Paolo Giaccone","city":"Palermo","pr":"","zip":"90127","s":"NYR","lat":38.1166,"lon":13.3636,"c":"Adriana Cordova, MD · +39 091 655 34 00 · adriana.cordova@policlinico.pa.it"},{"f":"Policlinico San Matteo","city":"Pavia","pr":"","zip":"27100","s":"NYR","lat":45.1921,"lon":9.1592,"c":"Adele Sgarella, MD · +39 0382502288 · a.sgarella@smatteo.pv.it"},{"f":"Azienda Ospedaliero Universitaria Pisana","city":"Pisa","pr